ith an authored gap, or cells that do not fit the column grid. Edit that row or table directly.","edit.table-merge-not-rectangle":"The cells to merge do not form a rectangle, or the rectangle holds only one cell. Name the top-left and bottom-right cells of a rectangle that no merged cell crosses, then merge again.","edit.table-split-unsupported":"The cell cannot split into these counts. A cell merged over several rows splits into a number of rows that divides its rows, each new column must keep the minimum column width, and a table without a column grid splits into a divisor of the columns the cell spans.","edit.table-insert-refused":"A table cannot be inserted at the selection, for example inside a field or a locked content control. Move the caret first.","edit.table-of-contents-refused":"The table of contents could not be inserted or updated at this place. Check that the selection is in the main document body.","edit.unsupported-content":"The edit touches content the editor shows but cannot change yet. The content is kept as it is.","edit.operation-unsupported":"This editing API operation or option is not supported by this runtime or host. Check the compatibility notes for the member you called.","edit.unsupported-story":"This part of the document, such as a header, a footer or a note, does not support this edit.","edit.unmapped-change":"The browser changed the page in a way the editor could not express as a document edit, so the change was undone.","edit.stale-target":"The operation addresses content that no longer exists, usually after a remote or undone change. Read the document again and retry.","edit.invalid-argument":"The arguments are not valid for this target, such as text with a character the call does not take, a value out of range, or a range that spans more than the call allows. Check each argument against the method or editor command you called.","edit.resource-limit":"The edit would exceed a size or nesting limit. Split the change into smaller edits.